<view class="intro-page">
  <view class="header">
    <view class="headline">NINA 会读取哪些数据？</view>
    <view class="page-subtitle">仅读取你的微信读书数据，用于生成专属洞察</view>
  </view>

  <view class="items">
    <view class="nina-card item">
      <view class="item-icon">📚</view>
      <view class="item-body">
        <view class="item-title">书架与阅读记录</view>
        <view class="item-desc">读过的书、阅读时长与进度，勾勒你的阅读轨迹</view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="nina-card item">
      <view class="item-icon">✏️</view>
      <view class="item-body">
        <view class="item-title">划线与笔记</view>
        <view class="item-desc">你在书页间留下的划线和想法，是洞察的核心素材</view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="nina-card item">
      <view class="item-icon">🌌</view>
      <view class="item-body">
        <view class="item-title">专属知识宇宙</view>
        <view class="item-desc">AI 分析后生成阅读人格、兴趣结构与知识图谱</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="safe-note">🔒 你的 KEY 只保存在云端加密存储，不会展示给任何人</view>

  <view class="footer">
    <button class="btn-primary" bindtap="onStartImport">开始导入</button>
    <view class="skip" bindtap="onSkip">暂不导入，先看看</view>
  </view>
</view>
